  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project to drill 15 wells in Somaliland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to water in those areas for beneficiaries, which will help them in agriculture - Access to sufficient water for livestock, which helps increase livestock wealth - Raising the capacity of the local community to manage the resources of the wells implemented</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing potable water by implementing 15 deep artesian wells in several areas in Somaliland.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the completion of the deep artesian wells and their accessories, 400,000 people will benefit directly from the project - 45 individuals will benefit from training on how to manage and maintain the wells and their accessories.</narrative>
  </description>
